I have released ver 1.3 of prctl. This version adds an option "--fpemu"
that lets you set the floating point assist fault handling behavior for
a process.

Source files and IPF binaries are available from
<http://prctl.sourceforge.net>, <ftp://ftp.hp.com/pub/linux/prctl> and
<ftp://puffin.external.hp.com/pub/ia64>.

